# Minimal PSLF DYD fixture paired with IEEE 14 bus.epc.
# The records use existing GENROU GridDyn models. The WLWSCC record is
# intentionally ignored while generalized load behavior is deferred; static
# EPC loads retain the DYR-equivalent behavior.
